```bash
grep -rn "admin\|ifAdminStatus\|adminState" plugin_moxa_*/  --include=*.rs | grep -i interface | head
```
記錄確切 URI 路徑(預期類似 `interface/.../adminStatus`)。

- [ ] **Step 2: 驗證 ies_uri_handle_client update 可手動寫**

先不改 code,DUT(root)手動驗證寫入管道:
```sh
echo '{"adminStatus":2}' > /tmp/set.json   # 2=down,實際 payload 格式依 framework schema
/sbin/ies_uri_handle_client --type update --uri <確認的URI> --file /tmp/set.json
```
DUT 對照:
```sh
ip link   # 對應 port 應變 down
```
Expected: framework 真的收到並生效。**若格式不對**,調整 payload/URI 直到手動可寫 — 這是 handler 接線的前提。

- [ ] **Step 3: 在 ISS SET handler 接 ies_uri_handle_client**

ifAdminStatus SET handler(PoC 簡化 phase):
```c
    /* Plan C PoC: ifAdminStatus SET -> framework via URI PATCH.
       TESTSET: validate range (1=up,2=down). COMMIT: write. UNDO: undoFailed (PoC). */
    if (/* phase == TESTSET */) {
        if (i4SetVal != 1 && i4SetVal != 2) return SNMP_ERR_WRONGVALUE;
        return SNMP_ERR_NOERROR;
    }
    if (/* phase == COMMIT */) {
        char cmd[512], payload[64];
        snprintf(payload, sizeof(payload), "{\"adminStatus\":%d}", (int)i4SetVal);
        /* write payload to temp file, then invoke client */
        FILE *f = fopen("/tmp/planc_set.json", "w");
        if (f) { fputs(payload, f); fclose(f); }
        snprintf(cmd, sizeof(cmd),
            "/sbin/ies_uri_handle_client --type update --uri %s --file /tmp/planc_set.json",
            "<確認的URI>");
        if (system(cmd) != 0) return SNMP_ERR_COMMITFAILED;
        return SNMP_ERR_NOERROR;
    }
    /* UNDO phase: PoC 不做 rollback */
    return SNMP_ERR_UNDOFAILED;
```
(實際 phase 判斷依 Aricent SET handler 框架;URI/payload 用 Step 1–2 確認的格式。)

